DICT PROD.                                                                      
AUTHORITY 'BACKUP'.                                                             
STATUS 'PROD'.                                                                  
KEEP LIST ROUTINES WHEN END -3 TO END = '-RTN'.                                 
DROP LIST MEMBER ROUTINE.                                                       
MAIL ONTO MAILDD.                                                               
PERFORM 'MAIL TEXT "./ ADD NAME=*" ',                                           
'MAIL GLOSS SIGN MEMBER * DETAIL GIVING DESC'                                   
KEPT-DATA.                                                                      
